Package: cytoarray
Type: Package
Title: Quantification and Differential Analysis of Membrane Cytokine Arrays
Version: 0.0.5
Authors@R: person("Junhao", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "junhao.wang.research@gmail.com")
Description: Quantifies dot-blot membrane cytokine arrays (e.g. R&D Systems
    Proteome Profiler) from scanned images. Registers a spot-layout template onto
    each membrane by an affine fit on the corner reference spots (automatic or by
    clicking six points), refines each spot automatically or interactively,
    measures each spot over a circular aperture with a local background, averages
    the duplicate spots, and runs limma-based differential analysis across groups.
    Between-array normalisation is off by default, following the manufacturer's
    guidance that the reference spots are not a loading control.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    EBImage,
    limma,
    statmod,
    grDevices,
    graphics,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
